    <section id="project-requirements" class="qc-project" aria-labelledby="project-title">
      <div class="qc-container qc-split">
        <div><p class="qc-eyebrow">YOUR NEXT OEM / ODM PROJECT</p><h2 id="project-title">Prepare Your Assembly &amp; Packaging Requirements</h2><p>Bring the component fit, assembly sequence, fastening, soldering, inspection criteria and packaging requirements into one project brief.</p><div class="qc-actions"><a class="qc-button ap-download" href="/resources/assembly-packaging-project-brief.txt" download="LEANODM-assembly-packaging-project-brief.txt">Download the Project Brief <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="qc-text-link" href="/rfq/?source=manufacturing-assembly-packaging#rfq-form">Discuss your assembly project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="qc-project-note">Use this checklist to prepare your project review or quote request. Downloading it does not submit an enquiry.</p></div>
        <div class="qc-project-list"><h3>Prepare for an assembly review</h3><ul><li>Drawings, component list and material specifications</li><li>Reference sample and required assembly sequence</li><li>Screw type, torque, fixture and fastening requirements</li><li>Soldered connections and acceptance requirements</li><li>Appearance, functional checks and inspection criteria</li><li>Accessories, protection, quantity, labels and carton arrangement</li><li>Target quantity and intended market</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
